data: {"id": "735f886cdfbb49b5-thinking-parallel_evidence-610", "run_id": "735f886cdfbb49b5", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 已采集事实\n\n1. **Pod 当前状态**：`workload-5dbb5dcd6c-kbwsx` 处于 `Pending` 阶段（Kubernetes YAML 确认 `phase: Pending`），容器状态为 `ContainerCreating`（`containerStatuses[0].reason=ContainerCreating`）。Prometheus 指标 `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason` 确认 waiting reason = `ContainerCreating`，`restarts=0`。\n\n2. **核心事件证据**：\n   - `Warning NoNetworkFound`：Multus CNI 插件报告 `cannot find network-attachment-definition 'unavailable-network' in namespace aiops-case-05`。\n   - `Warning FailedCreatePodSandBox`：kubelet 因 Mul", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1788778508005, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

event: node_complete
data: {"id": "735f886cdfbb49b5-node_complete-parallel_evidence", "run_id": "735f886cdfbb49b5", "seq": 611, "ts_ms": 1788778515970, "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "并发证据采集", "duration_seconds": 44.42, "state_snapshot": {"contract_version": "aiops.parallel-evidence-output.v2", "group_count": 1, "expected_group_count": 1, "terminal_group_count": 1, "join_complete": true, "diagnosed_count": 1, "inconclusive_count": 0, "error_count": 0, "errors": [], "groups": [{"group_id": "g1", "presentation_index": 0, "entities": [{"kind": "Pod", "namespace": "aiops-case-05", "name": "workload-5dbb5dcd6c-kbwsx"}], "diagnostic_status": "diagnosed", "artifact_ref": {"path": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/735f886cdfbb49b5-g1/lane_artifacts/g1/artifact.json", "sha256": "40baad7c34c89e45bf7790f825bae713ba1559ac0b8eb5efd2915bb5a6ddef52", "bytes": 2452}, "snapshot_sha256": "2a90550014e215abc7ca9155360360ca913455b2e13ddb23cf84f78cbb415547"}]}, "handoff_summary": ""}

