data: {"id": "735f886cdfbb49b5-final", "run_id": "735f886cdfbb49b5", "seq": 615, "ts_ms": 1788778526782, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-05/workload-5dbb5dcd6c-kbwsx` | ContainerCreating | Pod workload-5dbb5dcd6c-kbwsx 卡在 ContainerCreating (Pending) 状态，无法创建沙箱 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | kubelet | `FailedCreatePodSandBox: Failed to create pod sandbox: rpc error: ... failed to setup network for sandbox ... plugin type=\"multus\" name=\"multus-cni-network\" failed (add)` | 证实 Pod 在创建阶段因网络插件失败而受阻，处于卡死状态 |\n| 2 | K8s Event | multus | `NoNetworkFound: cannot find a network-attachment-definition (unavailable-network) in namespace (aiops-case-05): network-attachment-definitions.k8s.cni.cncf.io \"unavailable-network\" not found` | 精准定位网络失败的具体原因：Multus 找不到名为 `unavailable-network` 的 CNI 定义 |\n| 3 | K8s Config | Pod Annotations | `k8s.v1.cni.cncf.io/networks: unavailable-network` | 暴露 Pod 的显式引用配置，与事件中的缺失对象直接对应 |\n| 4 | K8s State | Pod/Container | `Status: ContainerCreating` / `Ready: False (ContainersNotReady)` | 描述当前 Pod 的最终停滞状态，证实启动未成功 |\n| 5 | Metric | Prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason{reason=\"ContainerCreating\"} = 1` | 从监控维度确认该 Pod 处于等待状态，且非 `Failed` 或 `OOMKilled` 等应用/资源型原因 |\n\n**证据关联说明：**\n事件 (fact-1, fact-2) 给出了明确的错误堆栈，指出 Multus 插件报错是因为找不到 `unavailable-network` 定义；配置 (fact-3) 在 Pod 的 Annotations 中找到了该引用的确切位置，形成了从“定义缺失”到“插件报错”再到“Pod 卡住”的完整事实闭环。指标 (fact-5) 排除了其他等待原因。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nPod YAML 声明了不存在的 network-attachment-definition 'unavailable-network' → Multus CNI 插件查找失败并返回 'not found' 错误 → Kubelet 因网络设置失败无法创建 Pod Sandbox → Pod 状态维持在 ContainerCreating/Pending，无业务日志或 Trace 产生\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n**已确认的根因：**\nPod `aiops-case-05/workload-5dbb5dcd6c-kbwsx` 的配置中存在对 NetworkAttachmentDefinition `unavailable-network` 的引用（证据编号 3），但该定义在 `aiops-case-05` 命名空间中不存在（证据编号 2）。这导致 Multus CNI 插件无法完成网络配置，进而导致 Kubelet 创建沙箱失败（证据编号 1），最终 Pod 卡在 `ContainerCreating` 状态（证据编号 4）。\n\n由于容器未能成功启动，未产生任何应用日志或业务流量（Logging/Tracing 维度缺失为物理预期，非故障掩盖）。现有 Kubernetes 事件与配置事实已构成充分证据，足以解释当前故障现象。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.2m\n├─ 问题定位: 14.3s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 44.4s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-05/workload-5dbb5dcd6c-kbwsx: 44.4s (Evidence 36.5s, RCA 7.7s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 10.8s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-05/workload-5dbb5dcd6c-kbwsx**: pod-volume-mount-failed\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 69.557, "metrics": {"run_id": "735f886cdfbb49b5", "mttr": {"value": "1.2m", "seconds": 69.57326292991638, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "42%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-volume-mount-failed", "pass": true, "score": 0.9, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-volume-mount-failed"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 69573.26292991638, "llm_calls": 14, "llm_duration_ms": 56146.215200424194, "tool_calls": 14, "executed_tool_calls": 9, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 4, "successful_tool_calls": 13, "failed_tool_calls": 1, "tool_duration_ms": 32701.487064361572, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 12989.315271377563}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 14321.7453956604, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence": {"name": "并发证据采集", "duration_ms": 44420.2094078064, "success": true}, "evidence": {"name": "evidence", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "rca": {"name": "rca", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "conclusion": {"name": "汇总总结", "duration_ms": 10799.94797706604, "success": true}}, "success": true, "errors": []}}

